1. Nf3 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. d4 Bg7 4. Nc3 O-O 5. e4 d6 6. Be2 e5 7. d5 a5 8. Bg5 h6
9. Bh4 Na6 10. Nd2 h5 $5 {[ A little unusual, Black usually plays Bd7 or Qe8
first. Why now tries to take advantage of this ]} 11. Bg5 Qe8 12. f3 Bd7 13.
Be3 Nh7 14. Bd3 $6 {[/\ 0-0-0 ]} (14. a3 a4 $6 15. Nb5 $1 $16) 14... Qe7 15.
Qe2 Bf6 16. O-O-O Bg5 17. h4 Bxe3 18. Qxe3 Nc5 $15 19. Be2 {[ /\ g4 ]} f5 20.
Rdg1 $2 (20. exf5 $1 $13) 20... f4 $17 21. Qf2 Kh8 22. Kc2 c6 23. Kb1 {[ White
was already in time trouble ]} a4 24. g3 fxg3 25. Rxg3 Be8 26. Qe3 Rf4 27. Rgh3
Bd7 28. R3h2 Qd8 29. Bd1 Qa5 30. Rg1 Rg8 31. Ne2 Rf6 32. Rhg2 cxd5 33. cxd5 Bb5
34. Nc3 Bd3+ 35. Bc2 Qa6 36. Bxd3 Nxd3 37. Rh2 a3 38. b3 Rc8 39. Nc4 Nf4 40.
Rc2 Rcf8 41. Rg3 (41. Qb6 $1 $13 {[ Commentary room x a3 d6 ]}) 41... b5 42.
Nb6 b4 43. Nd7 bxc3 44. Nxf6 Nxf6 45. Rg1 Nd7 46. Rxg6 Qf1+ 47. Rc1 c2+ 48. Ka1
Qe2 49. Rcg1 {[#]} Qd1+ 50. Qc1 Qd4+ 0-1

