1. c4 Nf6 2. Nc3 g6 3. d4 Bg7 4. e4 O-O 5. Be3 d6 6. f3 Nbd7 7. Qd2 c5 8. Nge2
a6 9. Bh6 Bxh6 10. Qxh6 b5 11. h4 bxc4 12. h5 e5 13. d5 Nb6 14. g4 Nxg4 $5 {
[#] [ An ingenious idea that deserved to work but did not ]} 15. fxg4 g5 16.
Bh3 f6 17. Rf1 Ra7 18. O-O-O Raf7 19. Rf2 Bd7 20. Rdf1 {[ Unfortunately for
Black the white queen exerts so much influence he gets no time to trap it ]}
