1. c4 g6 2. Nc3 Bg7 3. d4 d6 4. Nf3 Nf6 5. Bg5 c6 6. e3 a6 7. a3 b5 8. Be2 bxc4
9. Bxc4 Nbd7 10. O-O O-O 11. Rc1 c5 {[ 11..Bb7 ]} 12. dxc5 Nxc5 13. b4 $16 {
[#]'} Ncd7 14. Bd5 Ra7 15. Nd4 Nb8 16. a4 Rc7 17. Qb3 e6 18. Bf3 (18. Ba8 $1 {
[ Mestel /\ 18..Ra7 19.Nc6 ]}) 18... h6 19. Bh4 g5 20. Bg3 e5 $1 21. Nde2 Be6
22. Bd5 Nxd5 23. Nxd5 Nc6 24. e4 Bxd5 25. exd5 Ne7 {[ Now Black holds the
balance thanks to counterplay against d5 ]} 26. f3 Rxc1 27. Rxc1 Qa8 28. b5 {
[ Black is now able to force a draw ]} (28. Nc3 Rc8 29. Rb1 Nf5 30. Bf2 $14 {
[ /\ b5 ]}) 28... axb5 29. axb5 Qxd5 30. Qxd5 Nxd5 31. Rd1 Ne3 32. Rxd6 Rb8 33.
