1. d4 g6 2. e4 d6 3. c4 e5 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Bg5 (6. dxe5 dxe5 (6...
Nxe5 7. Nxe5 dxe5 8. Qxd8+ Kxd8 9. Bg5+ f6 10. O-O-O+ Bd7 11. g3 $2 fxg5 12.
Bh3 Nf6 $19) 7. Qxd8+ Kxd8 (7... Nxd8 8. Nd5 Ne6 9. Ng5 $16) 8. Bg5+ f6 9.
O-O-O+ $14) 6... Qd7 $5 (6... f6 7. Be3 Nh6 $1) 7. dxe5 h6 $1 {[#] [ A nice
intermezzo and a TN, Black wants to castle queenside later ]} 8. Be3 (8. Bh4 $1
) 8... dxe5 9. Qxd7+ Bxd7 10. O-O-O O-O-O 11. Be2 Nge7 12. h3 {[ 12.Nd5 ]} f5
$1 $10 13. exf5 gxf5 14. Nd5 Ng6 {[ Mestel plays for complications and is soon
rewarded, 14..Be6 was good for equality ]} 15. g3 Be6 16. h4 e4 17. Ne1 (17.
Nd4 $2 Nxd4 18. Bxd4 Bxd4 19. Rxd4 c6 $17) 17... Nge5 18. Nc2 Kb8 19. Rd2 $2 {
[ Missing the concealed threat ]} (19. b3 Bxd5 20. cxd5 Ne7 21. Bc4) 19... Nd3+
$1 $17 20. Bxd3 exd3 21. Rxd3 Ne5 22. Rdd1 Nxc4 23. Nc3 Nxe3 24. Nxe3 c6 25.
Rxd8+ Rxd8 26. Re1 Rd6 27. Kc2 a5 {[ Black's plan is to gain space and advance
his king in order to restrict the Black knights, at the right moment he will
be able to exchange advantageously]} 28. b3 b5 29. Ng2 Bd4 30. Nf4 Bd7 31. Nd1
c5 32. Re7 Bc6 33. Re6 Be4+ 34. Kc1 Kc7 35. Ne3 Kd7 36. Rxd6+ Kxd6 37. Kd2
Bxe3+ $1 $19 38. fxe3 b4 39. Ne2 Ke5 40. Nc1 Bb1 41. Nd3+ Bxd3 42. Kxd3 h5 43.
Kd2 Kd5 44. Kd3 c4+ 45. bxc4+ Kc5 46. e4 fxe4+ 47. Kxe4 Kxc4 48. Ke3 a4 0-1

