1. c4 c6 2. Nf3 d5 3. d4 Nf6 4. Nc3 dxc4 5. a4 Bf5 6. e3 e6 7. Bxc4 Bb4 8. O-O
O-O 9. Qe2 Ne4 {[ A relatively unusual move, 9..Nbd7 10.e4 Bg6 is the main
line ]} 10. Bd3 $1 {[ An excellent pawn sacrifice for space and time ]} Nxc3 $5
{[ I think this may be new, 10..Bxc3 11.bxc3 Nxc3 12.Qc2 Bxd3 13.Qxd3 Nd5 14.
Ba3 Re8 15.Rb1 b6 16.Rfc1 with good play was Euwe-Alekhine WCh 1937. ]} 11.
bxc3 Bxc3 12. Rb1 Qc8 {[ To defend b7 and f5 ]} 13. Ba3 Re8 14. Bxf5 exf5 15.
Ne5 {[ /\ Qc4 +- ]} Ba5 16. Qc4 Re6 17. e4 $3 {[#] [ Only this way, the e4
square must be blocked ]} (17. Nxf7 Kxf7 18. d5 Re4 $1 $19) 17... Rf6 (17...
fxe4 18. Nxf7 Kxf7 19. d5 {[#]} Re5 20. dxc6+ Kf6 21. cxb7 $18) 18. Be7 $1 Re6
19. Bh4 {[ Black is still defenceless against the coming sacrifice ]} fxe4 20.
Nxf7 $1 {[#]} Kxf7 21. d5 b6 (21... Rd6 22. dxc6+ Kf8 23. cxb7 Qxc4 24. bxa8=Q
$18) 22. dxe6+ Qxe6 23. Rbc1 a6 24. Rfd1 Ra7 25. Qxe6+ Kxe6 26. Bg3 $18 Nd7 27.
Rxc6+ Kf7 28. Bc7 Ke7 29. Rd4 1-0

