1. d4 d5 2. c4 dxc4 3. e3 Nf6 4. Bxc4 e6 5. Nf3 c5 6. Nc3 a6 7. a4 Be7 8. O-O
Nc6 9. d5 exd5 10. Nxd5 Nxd5 11. Bxd5 Bg4 12. Qb3 O-O 13. Bd2 Bxf3 14. gxf3 Qc7
(14... Bd6 15. f4 Bxf4 16. exf4 Ne7 17. Bxb7 Rb8 18. Bc3 Qc7 $13) 15. Bc3 Rad8
16. Kh1 Na5 17. Rg1 g6 (17... Nxb3 18. Rxg7+ Kh8 19. Rg8+ $3 (19. Rxf7+ Nd4 $1)
19... Kxg8 20. Rg1+ Bg5 21. Rxg5#) 18. Qd1 (18. Qa2 c4 19. Rad1 $16) 18... Nc6
19. f4 Nb4 (19... Nd4 20. Qh5 Kh8 21. Qf3 $18) 20. Bxb4 (20. Rxg6+ hxg6 21. Qh5
gxh5 22. Rg1+ Kh7 {[ This had been's White's intention but he stopped himself
at the last minute. ]}) 20... cxb4 21. Qf3 Bf6 22. Rab1 $14 {[ /\ b3 e4 ]} Qa5
23. e4 $1 Qxa4 24. e5 Bg7 25. f5 Kh8 26. f6 Bh6 27. Rbd1 (27. Bxf7 Rxf7 28. e6
Rc7 29. e7 Rdc8 30. Rbd1 $18 Re8) 27... Qb5 28. b3 Qc5 29. Rd3 Qc7 30. Qg3 {
[ Black is helpless against Qh4 and Rh3 ]} Rfe8 31. Qh4 (31. f4 Qc2 $13) 31...
Qxe5 32. Qxh6 Qxf6 33. Rf3 Qd6 34. Bxf7 Qc6 35. Rgg3 Re7 36. Bc4 $2 {[ Time
trouble, Black gets back in the game ]} (36. Bxg6 $1 $18) 36... b5 37. Qg5 Re1+
38. Kg2 Rdd1 39. Bf7 Kg7 40. Qf4 Rg1+ 41. Kh3 Qd7+ 42. Qg4 Qxg4+ 43. Rxg4 Rxg4
(43... Rge1 $1 {[ /\ a5 Re7 ]}) 44. Kxg4 Rg1+ 45. Kh3 a5 46. Be8 Rg5 47. Rf7+
Kh6 48. Rb7 a4 49. bxa4 bxa4 50. Bxa4 Rh5+ 51. Kg3 Rg5+ 52. Kf3 Rf5+ 53. Kg2
Rg5+ 54. Kf1 Rh5 55. Bb3 Rxh2 56. Bg8 Kg5 57. Bxh7 Kf6 58. Bg8 Rh4 59. Rb6+ Kg7
60. Bb3 1-0

