1. e4 c5 2. c3 d6 3. d4 Nf6 4. Bd3 cxd4 5. cxd4 g6 6. Nf3 Bg7 7. O-O O-O 8. h3
Nc6 9. Nc3 e5 10. d5 Nd4 11. Nxd4 exd4 12. Ne2 Re8 13. Ng3 Nd7 14. b3 Qh4 (
14... h5 15. Bb2 h4 16. Ne2 Nc5 $13 {[ /\ 17.f4 f5! ]}) 15. Bb2 Ne5 16. Bxd4 f5
17. Bxe5 $1 {[ By far the most convincing move and a difficult idea to find.
Giving up all the dark squares looks like a very bad idea but Emms gets them
back in a very radical way ]} (17. Bb5 f4 18. Bxe8 Bxh3 $1 $13 {[ Commentary
room ]}) 17... Bxe5 18. exf5 $1 Bxa1 19. Qxa1 Kf7 {[ A sure sign Black is in
desperate straits ]} 20. fxg6+ hxg6 21. Qb1 Bf5 $18 (21... Qf6 22. Ne4 Qe7 23.
f4 Kg7) 22. Nxf5 gxf5 23. Bxf5 Re5 24. Be6+ Kg7 25. Rc1 Rf8 26. g3 Qe4 27. Rc7+
Kg6 28. Qxe4+ Rxe4 29. Rc2 b5 30. Kg2 b4 31. h4 a5 32. f4 Re3 33. f5+ Kg7 34.
g4 Rc3 35. Rf2 Rh8 36. f6+ Kg6 37. g5 Rxh4 38. f7 {[#]} 1-0

