a3 a5 9. d3 O-O 10. Be3 Be6 11. Qc1 $6 Nd4 12. Bxd4 exd4 13. Ne4 (13. Nb5 c5
14. b4 axb4 15. axb4 Rc8 16. Na7 Ra8 17. Nb5 $10 {[ Hodgson ]}) 13... a4 14.
Nc5 Bc8 $6 (14... Bd5 $1 $15 15. Ne1 Bxg2 16. Nxg2 Qd5) 15. b4 $10 axb3 16.
Nxb3 Bf6 17. Nfd2 g6 18. Ne4 Bg7 19. Nec5 Nd5 20. a4 Nc3 21. Re1 Re8 22. Qc2 {
[ 22.Bf3 ]} c6 23. a5 Qc7 24. Na4 (24. Bf3 $1 {[ /\ Na4 ]}) 24... Be6 25. Nxd4
$2 {[ In a quiet position where he has reasonable chances White initiates
tactics and comes off worst ]} (25. Nac5 $10) 25... Qxa5 $1 26. Nxe6 $2 {
[ Missing Black's amazing reply ]} (26. Nxc3 Qxa1 27. Rxa1 Rxa1+ 28. Nd1 Bxd4
29. e3 Rea8 $1 30. exd4 (30. Bf3 R8a2 $19) 30... R8a2 $19) 26... Nxe2+ $1 {[#]}
27. Rxe2 Bxa1 {[ White cannot hold his hanging knights ]} 28. Nec5 Rxe2 29.
Qxe2 Bd4 30. Qe7 Qd2 31. Ne4 Qd1+ 0-1

