Na5 9. Qd2 Rb8 10. Ba2 c6 11. Nf3 Nf6 12. Bh6 $5 {[#]} Nxe4 13. Qf4 Bxh6 14.
Qxf7+ Kd7 15. Qe6+ Kc7 16. Qxe4 Bf5 17. Qh4 Bg7 18. O-O h6 $1 {[ /\ ..g5
preventing Ne2-f4 ]} 19. Qf4 Rf8 20. Qe3 g5 21. Ng3 $5 {[ Insisting Black
takes the c2 pawn ]} Bxc2 22. Qe2 $1 b3 23. Qxa6 Ra8 24. Qe2 Rxf3 $1 25. gxf3 (
25. Qxf3 bxa2 $19) 25... Bxd4 26. Rae1 Bxb2 $2 (26... e5 27. Bb1 Bxb1 28. Rxb1
Nb7 $15) 27. Bxb3 $1 Bxb3 28. Qxb2 e5 $1 {[ In the time scramble White goes
down very quickly ]} 29. Rb1 $6 Qf8 30. Qc3 Bd5 31. Ne4 g4 $1 $17 32. Rfd1 gxf3
33. Rxd5 Qg8+ 34. Ng3 Qxd5 35. Rb5 $2 Qd1+ {[ 36.Nf1 Rg8+ -+ which brought
Mestel to 8 points and a well deserved share of second place ]} 0-1

